# Native projection only; arguments/proof policy remain in SysML and owning Org.
def cell: gsub("\\|";"\\vert{}")|gsub("\n";" ");
"#+TITLE: Generational barrier writer and capability matrices",
"#+SETUPFILE: ../../../modeling/org/setup.org",
"#+CATEGORY: gc",
"#+PROPERTY: header-args :eval never :exports code",
"",
"* RESEARCH Native-derived writer contracts",
":PROPERTIES:",":CUSTOM_ID: barrier-writer-matrix",":AUTHORITY: GambitGenerationalBarrier",":EVIDENCE_CLASS: native-evaluated-projection",":END:",
"",
"This is a view of models/sysml/generational-barrier.sysml. Edit the native model, then regenerate; rows are not source-closure proofs.",
"",
"#+NAME: barrier-actual-writers",
"| Family | Current source anchors | Actual selected chain | Target store contract | Boundary |",
"|---+---+---+---+---|",
(.barrierWriters[]|"| "+([.writerId,.sourceAnchors,.actualChain,.storeClass,.boundary]|map(cell)|join(" | "))+" |"),
"",
"* RESEARCH Capability amplification and net-benefit conditions",
":PROPERTIES:",":CUSTOM_ID: barrier-amplification-matrix",":AUTHORITY: GambitGenerationalBarrier",":END:","",
"#+NAME: barrier-capability-amplification",
"| Capability | Mechanism | Removable work | Added work | Positive condition | Falsifier |",
"|---+---+---+---+---+---|",
(.amplification[]|"| "+([.capability,.mechanism,.removedWork,.addedWork,.condition,.falsifier]|map(cell)|join(" | "))+" |"),
"",
"[[file:generational-barrier-design.org][Source argument, failure custody, mathematical scopes and cost units]]. No native performance result or staffing estimate is encoded."
,"",
"* Native diagram edge meanings",
"#+NAME: barrier-diagram-edges",
"| Source | Consumer | Full contract |",
"|---+---+---|",
(.barrierEdges[]|"| "+([.producer.nodeId,.consumer.nodeId,.labelText]|map(cell)|join(" | "))+" |")
